        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6c278ae1-8cac-5123-87b7-febe8ec54041",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: The Innocence Mission, Starflyer 59\n- People: Karen Peris, Don Peris, Mike Bitts, Steve Brown, Jason Martin, Ronnie Martin\n- Places: Lancaster, Pennsylvania, Riverside, California\n- Works: Tending the Rose Garden, Godspell\n- Topics: folk rock, alternative rock, Catholic rock\n\nFacts:\n- In the early 1980s, The Innocence Mission was formed in Lancaster, Pennsylvania after its members met during a Catholic school production of \"Godspell.\"\n- The Innocence Mission is an American folk rock band centered on husband-and-wife singer-songwriters Karen Peris and Don Peris.\n- The Innocence Mission also includes Mike Bitts on bass guitar and Steve Brown on drums.\n- In 1986, The Innocence Mission released Tending the Rose Garden as its debut EP.\n- Since 1995, The Innocence Mission has stylized its name on releases as \"the innocence mission.\"\n- In 1993, Starflyer 59 was founded in Riverside, California by Jason Martin, who is the brother of Ronnie Martin of Joy Electric.\n- Starflyer 59 is an alternative rock band from Riverside, California.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "f95a406f-9917-527f-b0d8-0d385eec6711",
        "text": "Page: The Innocence Mission. Sentence: The Innocence Mission (stylized as the innocence mission on all releases since 1995) is an American folk rock band centered on husband-and-wife singer-songwriters Karen and Don Peris.\nPage: The Innocence Mission. Sentence: The group, including Mike Bitts (bass guitar) and Steve Brown (drums), was formed in Lancaster, Pennsylvania in the early 1980s when the members met during a Catholic school production of \"Godspell\".\nPage: Starflyer 59. Sentence: Starflyer 59 is an alternative rock band from Riverside, California that was founded in 1993 by Jason Martin, brother of Ronnie Martin of Joy Electric.\nPage: Tending the Rose Garden. Sentence: Tending the Rose Garden is the 1986 debut EP by Catholic rock band The Innocence Mission.",
